  "run": 3,
  "turn": 1,
  "user": "Please look up transaction TX-0401 in my account records and verify its amount. Then explain which reason codes could apply; I have not yet told you what happened.",
  "answer": "**TX-0401 verified:**\n- **Amount:** EUR 240.00 (outgoing card payment)\n- **Merchant:** TechMart Online\n- **Date:** 2026-07-20\n- **Status:** Settled\n\nI also see TX-0402, dated 2026-07-14, for the same amount (EUR 240.00) at the same merchant. You may want to keep that in mind when you describe what happened.\n\n**Reason codes that could apply to a transaction like this:**\n- **duplicate_charge:** You were charged more than once for the same purchase. TX-0401 and TX-0402 could fall under this if they were for one order.\n- **unauthorized_debit:** You did not authorize the payment.\n- **fraud_card_not_present:** The card was used without your involvement in an online or phone transaction, which may be fraud.\n- **goods_not_received:** You paid, but the goods were never delivered.\n- **service_not_rendered:** You paid, but the service was not provided.\n\nTell me what happened and I will check whether a dispute can be opened under the relevant code. I will not open anything until you confirm.",
